{
  "bodyHash": "vm8YxgqBhT8=",
  "content": "<p>歡迎來到：<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/402659/description_018a9109-3bb2-45f9-bf09-912f0271ed02.png\"><br><br><br>Minecraft 擁有許多潛力食材，但似乎官方對開發這塊並不感興趣，因為他們幾乎沒有添加新的食物。於是我決定自己動手，製作一個展示 Minecraft 能或該如何運用食物的 Mod。超過80道新菜餚、8種新蛋糕、可放置的煎餅堆與可放置的布朗尼盤。<br>牛奶瓶、起司、填餡海泡菜與起司蛋糕都能像牛奶一樣清除藥水效果。<br><br>如果你想要更多食物擴展，可以看看我的第二個 Mod <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/drop-the-meat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Drop the Meat</a>。它為所有被動生物（雪人除外）添加了肉類。<br><br>歡迎將此 Mod 加入你的模組包中 c:<br><br>若同時使用 Farmer's Delight，將新增蛋糕切片與烹飪鍋配方。感謝 vectorwing 允許我以其蛋糕切片紋理為基礎製作自己的蛋糕切片紋理。另外也包含其他雜項模組相容性。<br><br>此 Mod 目前僅支援 Forge。我尚未決定是否製作 Fabric 版本，請勿在留言中要求。<br><br></p><p>___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p><p>可投入堆肥桶的物品：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>-綜合堅果 (30%)<br>-烤竹子 (85%)<br>-烤甜菜根 (85%)<br>-烤雞蛋 (85%)<br>-烤海龜蛋 (85%)<br>-烤西瓜 (85%)<br>-烤蘋果 (85%)<br>-起司 (85%)<br>-仙人掌片 (50%)<br>-烤仙人掌片 (85%)<br>-莓果餅乾 (85%)<br>-蜂蜜餅乾 (85%)<br>-馬鈴薯餅乾 (85%)<br>-南瓜餅乾 (85%)<br>-葵花籽餅乾 (85%)<br>-馬鈴薯片 (85%)<br>-香辣薯片 (85%)<br>-甜菜片 (85%)<br>-蘋果片 (85%)<br>-填餡海泡菜 (85%)<br>-礦工沙拉 (85%)<br>-蘋果派 (100%)<br>-甜菜根派 (100%)<br>-莓果派 (100%)<br>-疙瘩派 (100%)<br>-毒藥派 (100%)<br>-煎餅 (100%)<br>-莓果煎餅 (100%)<br>-蜂蜜煎餅 (100%)<br>-培根煎餅 (100%)<br>-可麗餅 (100%)<br>-布朗尼 (100%)<br>-莓果布朗尼 (100%)<br>-法式吐司 (100%)<br>-馬鈴薯煎餅 (100%)<br>-莓果蛋糕 (100%)<br>-胡蘿蔔蛋糕 (100%)<br>-起司蛋糕 (100%)<br>-巧克力蛋糕 (100%)<br>-罌粟籽蛋糕 (100%)<br>-冰淇淋蛋糕 (100%)<br>-玫瑰蛋糕 (100%)<br>-歌萊果蛋糕 (100%)<br>-書本蛋糕 (100%)<br>-煎餅堆 (100%)<br>-布朗尼盤 (100%)</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;村民交易：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>（購買/出售）</p>\n<p>-二級農夫：<br>1個綠寶石換4個起司<br>1個綠寶石換4個蘋果派<br>1個綠寶石換4個甜菜根派<br>1個綠寶石換4個莓果派</p>\n<p>-三級農夫：<br>3個綠寶石換18個莓果餅乾</p>\n<p>-四級農夫：<br>1個綠寶石換1個莓果蛋糕<br>1個綠寶石換1個胡蘿蔔蛋糕<br>1個綠寶石換1個巧克力蛋糕<br>1個綠寶石換4個煎餅</p>\n<p>-五級漁夫：<br>3份炸魚薯條換1個綠寶石</p>\n<p>-五級圖書館員：<br>1個書本蛋糕換2個綠寶石</p>\n<p>-四級屠夫：<br>1個綠寶石換6個肉糕<br>1個綠寶石換8個肉丸<br>1個綠寶石換12個辣雞翅</p>\n</div><p>___________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________</p><p>食物清單與合成配方（更詳細的列表也可在此<a href=\"https://github.com/Moralle/VanillaCookbook/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看</a>）：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>烤竹子 | 3飢餓 1.8飽和<br><br><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/cooked_bamboo.png?raw=true\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\"></p>\n<p>烤甜菜根 | 4飢餓 3.2飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/b1.png?raw=true\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>烤雞蛋 | 4飢餓 3.6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/cooked_egg.png?raw=true\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>烤西瓜 | 4飢餓 3.6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/b3_-_Kopie.png?raw=true\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>烤蘋果 | 6飢餓 4.8飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/b4_-_Kopie.png?raw=true\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>烤海龜蛋 | 8飢餓 12.8飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/b5.png?raw=true\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>烤嗅探者蛋 | 9飢餓 9飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2024-01-15_16.23.22.png?raw=true\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>仙人掌片 | 3飢餓 3.6飽和 | 50%機率造成1顆心傷害</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/cactus_slice.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>烤仙人掌片 | 8飢餓 12飽和 | 25%機率造成0.5顆心傷害</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/cooked_cactus_slice.png?raw=true\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>起司 | 3飢餓 1.8飽和 | 清除藥水效果</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/cheeseUpdate.png?raw=true\" width=\"420\" height=\"232\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>花園湯 | 6飢餓 7.2飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2022-05-08_10.19.26.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>南瓜湯 | 4飢餓 6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2022-05-08_10.17.27.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>魚湯 | 6飢餓 2.4飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>(任何生魚)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2020-09-09_21.58.25.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>蔬菜燉菜 | 8飢餓 12.8飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>(任何蘑菇。馬鈴薯和甜菜根可以互相替代)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2022-05-08_12.58.48.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>肉燉菜 | 7飢餓 14飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>(任何肉類)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/image.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>雞湯 | 6飢餓 9.6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2022-05-08_12.58.54.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>墨魚湯 | 3飢餓 0.6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2022-03-10_15.25.12.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>螢光墨魚湯 | 4飢餓 1.2飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2022-03-10_15.25.16.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>菌菇燉菜 | 6飢餓 7.2飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>(任何2種菌類)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2022-03-10_15.25.20.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>悶燒燉菜 | 3飢餓 3.6飽和 | 10秒抗火效果</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2022-03-10_15.25.24.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>純沙拉 | 4飢餓 2.4飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/blob/main/2022-03-10_15.25.28.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>海帶沙拉 | 5飢餓 6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>(任何生魚)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2020-09-09_21.59.14.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>水果沙拉 | 6飢餓 7.2飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2020-09-09_21.59.17.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>黃金水果沙拉 | 8飢餓 12飽和 | 獲得立即治療1</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-03-10_15.25.33.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>根莖沙拉 | 3飢餓 0.6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>(每種根莖都需要)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2020-09-09_21.59.23.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>馬鈴薯泥 | 6飢餓 7.8飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.57.30.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>蘋果醬 | 5飢餓 6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.58.43.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>蘑菇炒蛋 | 6飢餓 7.2飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>(任何蘑菇)<br><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.57.302.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>布丁 | 4飢餓 4.8飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_10.17.58.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>巧克力布丁 | 4飢餓 6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_10.18.03.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>果凍 | 4飢餓 3.6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-03-10_15.25.46.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>岩漿果凍 | 4飢餓 3.6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-03-10_15.25.49.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>蘋果派 | 8飢餓 4.8飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_10.18.07.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>甜菜根派 | 6飢餓 3飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.59.16.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>莓果派 | 7飢餓 4.2飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_10.18.11.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>疙瘩派 | 6飢餓 3飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.59.22.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>終界派 | 6飢餓 4.2飽和 | 像歌萊果一樣傳送，偏向視線方向</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/ender_pie.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>毒派 | 10飢餓 14.4飽和 | 15秒中毒3和噁心效果</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2020-09-09_22.00.22.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>莓果餅乾 | 2飢餓 0.4飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2020-09-09_22.00.27.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>蜂蜜餅乾 | 4飢餓 0.8飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2020-09-09_22.00.30.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>馬鈴薯餅乾 | 2飢餓 0.4飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2020-09-09_22.00.33.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>南瓜餅乾 | 2飢餓 0.4飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2020-11-26_18.22.14.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>向日葵籽餅乾 | 2飢餓 0.4飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2021-05-15_12.44.38.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>鬆餅 | 5飢餓 6.6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/pancake.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>莓果鬆餅 | 6飢餓 7.2飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.58.21.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>蜂蜜鬆餅 | 9飢餓 12.6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/honeypancake.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>培根鬆餅 | 8飢餓 12.8飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.57.201.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>法式可麗餅 | 6飢餓 7.8飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.58.032.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>布朗尼 | 6飢餓 6.6飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_10.18.27.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>莓果布朗尼 | 7飢餓 7飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_10.18.31.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>歌萊卷 | 8飢餓 12飽和 | 像歌萊果一樣傳送，偏向視線方向</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/chorus_roll.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>冰淇淋 | 2飢餓 2.4飽和 | 著火時可滅火</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.57.20.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>巧克力冰淇淋 | 3飢餓 3.6飽和 | 著火時可滅火</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.58.14.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>莓果冰淇淋 | 2飢餓 3.2飽和 | 著火時可滅火</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_12.58.03.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>三色冰淇淋 | 8飢餓 12.8飽和 | 著火時可滅火</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-05-08_10.18.19.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>南瓜冰棒 | 6飢餓 5.4飽和 | 著火時可滅火</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2020-11-26_18.22.23.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>雪角 | 7飢餓 8.4飽和 | 著火時可滅火</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>號角不會被消耗！</strong> 任何山羊角皆可接受<br><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/image (1).png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>甜烤肉串 | 6飢餓 1.8飽和</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/sweet_skewer.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>糖漬螢光莓 | 6飢餓 4.8飽和 | 獲得20秒夜視和發光效果</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/main/2022-03-10_15.23.53.png?raw=true\" width=\"496\" height=\"248\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>馬鈴薯片 | 2飢餓 1.2飽和 | 食用時50%機率清除飢餓效果</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/Moralle/ImageRepository/raw/